^(?:(?!\\\\\\\\Z).)*\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"`HANDOFF.md` records the verification command and its observed result.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"regex\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"HANDOFF.md\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"(?s)(?=.*python -m unittest discover -v)(?=.*(?:passed|pass|success|successful))\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The named Python files compile successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py test_solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-6\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Unittest discovery completes successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-7\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The implementation preserves input data, returns in case order, handles empty input, and propagates the first exception unchanged.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read the workspace files. Assess whether `last_index_many` calls `last_index` once per case using each tuple's positional arguments, preserves case order, returns an empty list for no cases, propagates the first exception unchanged, and does not mutate the cases or their arguments. Also assess whether the tests include meaningful batch coverage of these behaviors. Do not infer runtime outcomes from file contents.\\\"}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py test_solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The runner-provided workspace is the relative-path root for all named files.\\\",\\\"`solution.py`, `test_solution.py`, and `HANDOFF.md` are the intended file paths; requested targets may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The handoff's reported prior verification is context only; the contract requires a fresh verification command and `HANDOFF.md` to document its observed result.\\\",\\\"The precise day-1 API behavior is represented by the existing implementation and tests; no additional behavior beyond the supplied handoff is inferred.\\\"]}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":21416,\"cached_input_tokens\":18304,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":774,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":0}}\n"}
